<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portfólio - Arthur Kleber</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <header>
        <h1>Arthur Kleber</h1>

        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#">Sobre</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Tecnologias</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Contato</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN -->
    <main>
        <div class="text">
            <h2>Olá, eu sou Arthur Kleber 👋</h2>

            <p>
                Sou estudante e desenvolvedor front-end apaixonado por tecnologia,
                design e criação de interfaces modernas.
                Atualmente estou aprendendo HTML, CSS, JavaScript e React,
                buscando evoluir cada vez mais na programação.
            </p>

            <button>Meu Portfólio</button>
        </div>

        <div class="image">
            <img src="image.png" alt="Foto Arthur Kleber">
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- TECNOLOGIAS -->
    <section class="tech">
        <h2>Minhas Tecnologias</h2>

        <div class="tech-grid">

            <div class="tech-card">
                <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/html5/html5-original.svg">
                <p>HTML5</p>
            </div>

            <div class="tech-card">
                <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/css3/css3-original.svg">
                <p>CSS3</p>
            </div>

            <div class="tech-card">
                <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/javascript/javascript-original.svg">
                <p>JavaScript</p>
            </div>

            <div class="tech-card">
                <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/react/react-original.svg">
                <p>React</p>
            </div>

            <div class="tech-card">
                <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/python/python-original.svg">
                <p>Python</p>
            </div>

            <div class="tech-card">
                <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/github/github-original.svg">
                <p>GitHub</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Arthur Kleber - Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>


Css
/* RESET */
*{
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

/* BODY */
body{
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background-color: #f8fafc;
    color: #0f172a;
}

/* HEADER */
header{
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;

    padding: 20px 60px;

    background-color: #0f172a;
    color: white;

    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
}

header h1{
    font-size: 28px;
    color: #38bdf8;
}

nav ul{
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
    list-style: none;
}

nav a{
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 17px;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

nav a:hover{
    color: #38bdf8;
}

/* MAIN */
main{
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 60px;

    padding: 80px 60px;
    min-height: 90vh;
}

/* TEXTO */
.text{
    max-width: 550px;
}

.text h2{
    font-size: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.text p{
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #475569;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

/* BOTÃO */
.text button{
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 12px;

    background-color: #38bdf8;
    color: white;

    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.text button:hover{
    background-color: #0ea5e9;
    transform: scale(1.05);
}

/* IMAGEM */
.image img{
    width: 330px;
    height: 330px;

    object-fit: cover;

    border-radius: 25px;

    border: 5px solid #38bdf8;

    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}

/* TECNOLOGIAS */
.tech{
    padding: 80px 60px;
    text-align: center;
}

.tech h2{
    font-size: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
}

.tech-grid{
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
    gap: 30px;
}

.tech-card{
    background-color: white;

    padding: 30px 20px;

    border-radius: 20px;

    transition: 0.3s;

    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

.tech-card:hover{
    transform: translateY(-10px);
}

.tech-card img{
    width: 70px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.tech-card p{
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

/* FOOTER */
footer{
    background-color: #0f172a;
    color: white;

    text-align: center;

    padding: 25px;

    margin-top: 40px;
}
